ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Surrealism
Board: /styles/surrealism
Companions: surrealism-starter.html, surrealism-study.ai, surrealism-study.psd

Artboards
1. Precise impossible object, 2400 × 1600 px. One ordinary invented thing, sharp edges, one hard shadow, a flat daylight ground.
2. A note in the margin, plain sans: "second method — not automatism."

Palette
Sky #d7e0ea. Ground #c8bba8. Object #c0c6ce. Shadow a single transparent brown, one direction.

Rules
- Sharp edges. No blur, no automatic line, no frottage texture.
- One contradiction only.
- Shadow matches one light source.
- Do not reproduce any existing surrealist picture or object.
